- Replace `192.0.2.1` with the neighbor's IP address
- This configuration can also be applied at the global BGP level (`config>router>bgp`) or group level (`config>router>bgp>group`) if needed for multiple peers
- Sessions drop only when **no alternative routes** exist to reach the neighbor

