To configure your Nokia 7750 SR BGP groups for handling unexpected errors during polite reboots without dropping sessions:

```cli
configure router bgp group "group-name"
    graceful-restart
    error-handling
        update-fault-tolerance
    exit
exit
```

**Explanation:**  
- `graceful-restart` maintains sessions during reboots by preserving routes and suppressing updates.  
- `update-fault-tolerance` processes malformed UPDATE messages non-disruptively by treating them as withdrawals instead of resetting sessions.  

Apply this configuration to all relevant BGP neighbor groups.
