2. **`deterministic-med`**  
   Groups paths by neighbor AS before MED comparison, eliminating route arrival order dependencies and ensuring deterministic path selection.

This combination guarantees MED is the consistent tie-breaker across all paths, regardless of neighbor AS differences.
