To set up BGP for automatic path switching in your 6PE IPv6 label-based forwarding environment during link failures, use the following configuration:

```cli
configure router bgp
    backup-path label-ipv6
    add-paths
        label-ipv6 send 1 receive
    exit
```

### Key details:
1. **`backup-path label-ipv6`**:  
   Enables BGP Fast Reroute for labeled IPv6 routes. This computes backup paths to minimize downtime when primary paths fail.

