To enforce strict single-path selection for BGP with a specific peer on your Nokia 7750 SR, configure the following commands. Replace `<group-name>` and `<neighbor-ip>` with your actual group name and neighbor IP address.

```cli
configure router bgp group "<group-name>" neighbor "<neighbor-ip>"
    add-paths
        ipv4 send none receive none
        ipv6 send none receive none
        label-ipv4 send none receive none
        label-ipv6 send none receive none
    exit
exit
```

### Explanation:
- **`ipv4 send none receive none`**:  
  Disables sending and receiving multiple paths for **unlabeled IPv4** routes.
- **`ipv6 send none receive none`**:  
