**Key points:**  
1. **`error-handling update-fault-tolerance`** suppresses session resets when your AS is detected in the AS_PATH.  
2. Invalid routes are silently discarded, preventing routing loops.  
3. Apply this to specific misconfigured neighbors to avoid masking issues from other peers.  

