exit
```

**Key details:**  
- `helper-override-restart-time 300` forces your router to use a 300-second (5-minute) recovery timer instead of the peer's advertised value  
- `helper-override-stale-time 300` enforces your 5-minute stale route retention period for all route families  
- Both commands override the peer's advertised timers for any AFI/SAFI supported in its GR capability  
- Replace `<your-group-name>` and `<peer-ip>` with your specific BGP group name and neighbor IP address
