To address the issue of TCP sessions hanging when the remote end is unresponsive, configure the BGP keepalive interval and hold timer to ensure the session resets after 15 consecutive missed keepalives. Adjust these settings at the specific BGP neighbor level to avoid impacting other neighbors:

```cli
configure router bgp
