To configure the Nokia 7750 SR to ignore AS hop-count for BGP IPv6 multicast path selection:

```cli
configure router bgp
    group <group-name>
        neighbor <neighbor-ip>
            family mvpn-ipv6
                add-paths mvpn-ipv6 send none receive
            exit
        exit
    exit
exit
```

Replace `<group-name>` and `<neighbor-ip>` with your specific BGP group and neighbor IP. This configuration:
- Enables receiving multiple MVPN IPv6 paths from peers
- Disables sending multiple paths (`send none`)
- Allows paths with longer AS hop-counts to be considered in best-path selection

The router will evaluate received paths based on other BGP attributes (like local preference, MED, origin) instead of AS_PATH length.
