To ensure BGP-labeled routes only use your approved tunnel types, configure a resolution filter under the labeled routes transport tunnel family context. Here are the commands:

```cli
configure router bgp next-hop-resolution labeled-routes transport-tunnel family ipv4
    resolution-filter [sr-isis] [sr-ospf] [sr-ospf3] [sr-te] [sr-policy] [rsvp] [ldp] [bgp]
