configure router bgp next-hop-resolution labeled-routes transport-tunnel family ipv4
    resolution-filter sr-te sr-isis
    exit
exit
```

**Key notes**:
1. This filter **overrides default behavior** where any tunnel in the table is considered.
2. List **only your approved tunnel types**—unlisted types will be ignored.
3. Apply the same configuration under `family ipv6` if IPv6 routes require resolution.
