To optimize traffic paths for specific BGP-learned routes using SR-based steering on your Nokia 7750 SR, configure the following:

1. **Enable SR policy resolution** for the desired route family (e.g., IPv4) under BGP next-hop resolution. This ensures routes with matching color communities use SR policies:
```cli
