```cli
/configure router policy-options
policy-statement <POLICY_NAME>
    entry 10
        from
            neighbor <PEER_IP>
        exit
        action accept
        exit
    exit
```

4. **Ensure routes from targeted peers carry a color extended community** matching your SR policy. Use an import policy to attach the community:
```cli
/configure router policy-options
community <COLOR_COMM> members color:<VALUE>
policy-statement <IMPORT_POLICY_NAME>
    entry 10
        from
            neighbor <PEER_IP>
        exit
